OL,3,GNEWSATributes after body found in
OL,4,Asearch for soldier
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlowers have been placed at a bridge
OL,7,Fover the River Tyne after a body was
OL,8,Ffound in the water.
OL,10,FNorthumbria Police were searching for
OL,11,Fmissing soldier Liam Potts, 22, who
OL,12,Fserved with the Coldstream Guards and
OL,13,Fwas last seen heading towards Wylam in
OL,14,FNorthumberland in the early hours of
OL,15,FSaturday.
OL,17,FSpecialist officers recovered a body
OL,18,Fclose to Wylam Bridge on Tuesday
OL,19,Fafternoon. The force said formal
OL,20,Fidentification had yet to take place
OL,21,Fbut Liam's next of kin had been
OL,22,Fnotified.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
